msgid ""
"Mattermost currently supports three log formats: plain, JSON, and `GELF "
"<https://go2docs.graylog.org/current/getting_in_log_data/gelf.html>`__."
msgstr "OKR.BEST는 현재 plain, JSON, `GELF <https://go2docs.graylog.org/current/getting_in_log_data/gelf.html>`__\ 의 세 가지 로그 형식을 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/embedded-json-audit-log-schema.rst:952
msgid ""
"Plain log format uses `RFC3339 <https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc3339>`__ by default. See the :ref:`plain log format "
"configuration <administration-guide/manage/logging:plain log format "
"configuration options>` documentation for supported options."
msgstr "Plain 로그 형식은 기본적으로 `RFC3339 <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3339>`__\ 를 사용합니다. 지원되는 옵션은 :ref:`plain 로그 형식 구성 <administration-guide/manage/logging:plain log format configuration options>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/embedded-json-audit-log-schema.rst:955
msgid ""
"JSON log format uses `RFC3339 <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3339>`__"
" by default. See the :ref:`JSON log format configuration <administration-"
"guide/manage/logging:json log format configuration options>` "
"documentation for supported options."
msgstr "JSON 로그 형식은 기본적으로 `RFC3339 <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3339>`__\ 를 사용합니다. 지원되는 옵션은 :ref:`JSON 로그 형식 구성 <administration-guide/manage/logging:json log format configuration options>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/embedded-json-audit-log-schema.rst:959
msgid ""
"GELF log format uses `unixtime <https://www.unixtimestamp.com/>`__. See "
"the :ref:`GELF log format configuration <administration-"
"guide/manage/logging:gelf log format configuration options>` "
"documentation for supported options."
msgstr "GELF 로그 형식은 `unixtime <https://www.unixtimestamp.com/>`__\ 을 사용합니다. 지원되는 옵션은 :ref:`GELF 로그 형식 구성 <administration-guide/manage/logging:gelf log format configuration options>` 문서를 참고하세요."

